(CNCFusion Multi-Tool Change and Probe Test)
(No cutting motion. Uses the configured tool setter.)
(Operator must install each requested tool when prompted.)
(Run Dashboard Tool Setter Calibration and sync REF_Z before this test.)
(Requires tool table entries T1, T2, and T3.)
(Requires O113 tool-probe subroutine installed as 113.ngc.)

G21 G90 G17 G40 G49 G94 G97
G54
M5
M9

(MSG, Beginning multi-tool change test)

(MSG, Install Tool 1 when prompted)
T1 M6
O113 call [1]
G43 H1
(MSG, Tool 1 measured)
M3 S3000
G4 P5
M5

(MSG, Install Tool 2 when prompted)
T2 M6
O113 call [2]
G43 H2
(MSG, Tool 2 measured)
M3 S6000
G4 P5
M5

(MSG, Install Tool 3 when prompted)
T3 M6
O113 call [3]
G43 H3
(MSG, Tool 3 measured)
M3 S9000
G4 P5
M5

(MSG, Multi-tool change and probe test complete)
M9
G90
M2
